  "prefLabel": "Lab 1402.12 Emergency",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lab 1402.12 “Emergency” means any occurrence, including any failure of hazard control or monitoring equipment, or event internal or external to the permit space that could endanger entrants.\n\nSource. #14431, eff 11-22-25, EXPIRES: 11-22-35",
